  "interpretation_notes": [
    "TS 35.240/243/246 clause 7.2.0 says at least one message bit, but all three official design conformance suites explicitly include empty NIA messages in tests 1, 4 and 5. This implementation accepts zero-length messages to reproduce those official cases.",
    "The application computes Integrity on plaintext, appends MAC-I, and applies independently selected Ciphering. This application pipeline is not standardized NCA.",
    "POLYVAL implementation cases are listed separately for each of the three source documents, including repeated vectors. Internal snapshots are subchecks within six primitive cases and are not added to the 135-case total.",
    "Repository Markdown described the earlier baseline when this cloud evidence was recorded; the Korean documentation was updated for rc3."
  ],
